    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Herbert & Lansdowne are delighted to present Apartment 22, Longford House, IFSC, Dublin 1, to the market.\r\nThis impressive two-bedroom apartment offers a superb opportunity to acquire a modern, energy-efficient home in the heart of Dublin’s vibrant IFSC.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 62 sq. m., the property is A-rated, providing excellent energy efficiency and contemporary city living.\r\nLocated within this popular residential development, the apartment offers well-proportioned accommodation comprising an entrance hallway, spacious open-plan living and dining area, a modern fitted kitchen, two bedrooms, and a main bathroom. The generous living space provides an ideal setting for both relaxing and entertaining, while the A-rated energy performance is an attractive benefit for both owner-occupiers and investors.\r\n\r\nThe IFSC is one of Dublin’s most established residential and commercial districts, with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops and everyday amenities close by. The apartment is also exceptionally well served by public transport, with the LUAS, Dublin Bus and Connolly Station all within easy reach, providing convenient access throughout the city and beyond.\r\n\r\nThe property’s central location makes it particularly appealing to  working within the IFSC, Docklands and Dublin city centre, while its proximity to Trinity College, Grand Canal Square and the wider city centre further enhances its appeal.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is sure to appeal to those seeking a modern, energy-efficient apartment in a prime Dublin 1 location.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: The above particulars are issued by Herbert & Lansdowne Estate Agents on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Please note that we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
